WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Recover repairs a PostgreSQL cluster after a crash or a stuck instance.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
It checks the node's free disk space and the cluster's health first.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:23.000
The cluster is healthy, so there is nothing to recover. Finished in 4 seconds.

